WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.269
Roxy had to get to downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:09.740
She had to stop that giant pink blob!

3
00:00:09.741 --> 00:00:13.051
"I'll be back soon!" Roxy said to her friends.

4
00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:17.233
"I'm, uh, going to go look for Mara!"

5
00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:20.234
Roxy ran off.

6
00:00:20.235 --> 00:00:22.262
Jack scratched his head.

7
00:00:22.263 --> 00:00:25.784
"I thought Roxy didn't know where Mara is."

8
00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:27.492
Terrell frowned.

9
00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.921
"I hope she comes back soon.

10
00:00:29.922 --> 00:00:36.594
We can't play kickball with just two people."

11
00:00:36.595 --> 00:00:41.044
A minute later Roxy zoomed into downtown Metro City.

12
00:00:41.045 --> 00:00:44.116
The blob was pink and really, really big.

13
00:00:44.117 --> 00:00:48.015
Roxy watched it move slowly up the side of a skyscraper.

14
00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:51.482
"That looks like bubble gum," thought Roxy.

15
00:00:51.483 --> 00:00:53.326
She sniffed the air.

16
00:00:53.327 --> 00:00:55.983
"It smells like bubble gum too!"

17
00:00:55.984 --> 00:00:58.817
"Rocket Girl!" called a voice.

18
00:00:58.818 --> 00:01:00.804
It was Detective Smith.

19
00:01:00.805 --> 00:01:02.693
Roxy flew to him.

20
00:01:02.694 --> 00:01:05.236
"You know, Detective," she said.

21
00:01:05.237 --> 00:01:08.533
"You're supposed to throw your gum in the trash."

22
00:01:08.534 --> 00:01:12.572
"Ha-ha." Detective Smith pretended to laugh.

23
00:01:12.573 --> 00:01:15.014
"That's not my gum."

24
00:01:15.015 --> 00:01:18.548
"So where did that blob come from?" asked Roxy.

25
00:01:18.549 --> 00:01:20.942
Detective Smith shook his head.

26
00:01:20.943 --> 00:01:26.204
"Nobody knows. It's been here for an hour, and it keeps growing.

27
00:01:26.205 --> 00:01:31.470
If we don't do something soon, it will cover the entire city!"

28
00:01:31.471 --> 00:01:35.241
A bus came around the corner.

29
00:01:35.242 --> 00:01:38.160
"Ahh!" cried the bus driver.

30
00:01:38.161 --> 00:01:40.173
He slammed on the brakes.

31
00:01:40.174 --> 00:01:44.696
Screech! The bus skidded.

32
00:01:44.697 --> 00:01:48.401
The blob reached out. Shlurp!

33
00:01:48.402 --> 00:01:51.084
Pink slime oozed all over the bus.

34
00:01:51.085 --> 00:01:53.291
The blob pulled the bus closer.

35
00:01:53.292 --> 00:01:55.803
Everyone inside began to scream.

36
00:01:55.804 --> 00:01:58.536
"Rocket Girl, save us!"

37
00:01:58.537 --> 00:02:00.963
"Help! Help!"

38
00:02:00.964 --> 00:02:03.985
"This is terrible!" cried a man.

39
00:02:03.986 --> 00:02:06.860
"I'm going to be late for work!"

40
00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:11.478
Roxy shot toward the bus and grabbed its bumper.

41
00:02:11.479 --> 00:02:14.999
She pulled as hard as she could.

42
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:18.170
"Grr!" Roxy grunted.

43
00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:22.526
Shloop! The bus came free of the blob.

44
00:02:22.527 --> 00:02:25.735
"Thank you, Rocket Girl," said the driver.

45
00:02:25.736 --> 00:02:29.206
The blob groaned. Grarg!

46
00:02:29.207 --> 00:02:32.431
"What's it doing?" Roxy wondered.

47
00:02:32.432 --> 00:02:36.827
Grarg! The blob was growing some more.

48
00:02:36.828 --> 00:02:40.240
It soon filled the street and attached to another building.

49
00:02:40.241 --> 00:02:45.110
"Uh-oh," said Roxy. "The blob is getting bigger!"

50
00:02:45.111 --> 00:02:47.402
Roxy turned to the bus driver.

51
00:02:47.403 --> 00:02:51.860
"Drive away from here! Now!"

52
00:02:51.861 --> 00:02:55.582
The bus sped away as the blob moved to a third building.

53
00:02:55.583 --> 00:02:58.297
Suddenly Roxy heard a muffled sound.

54
00:02:58.298 --> 00:03:01.967
"What's that sound?" Roxy wondered.

55
00:03:01.968 --> 00:03:06.078
She listened with her super hearing.

56
00:03:06.079 --> 00:03:10.001
"Help! Help!"

57
00:03:10.002 --> 00:03:13.074
Roxy shot around to the other side of the blob.

58
00:03:13.075 --> 00:03:15.924
Someone was stuck in it.

59
00:03:15.925 --> 00:03:20.192
Roxy used her super strength to pull the person out.

60
00:03:20.193 --> 00:03:23.084
It was Mara!

61
00:03:23.085 --> 00:03:25.487
"Rocket Girl!" cried Mara.

62
00:03:25.488 --> 00:03:27.732
"I'm glad to see you!

63
00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:34.420
My bubble gum . . . It tried to eat me!"

